{"seq":2,"slug":"cam-programming","title":"CAM编程与仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/cam-programming","wordCount":1392,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"cam编程与仿真\">CAM编程与仿真</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>CAM（Computer Aided Manufacturing）是连接三维CAD模型与数控机床的桥梁。高质量的CAM编程不仅决定加工效率和零件质量，更直接关系到价值数百万的机床和刀具安全。以UG NX和PowerMill为核心平台，系统掌握从工艺分析到代码生成的完整数字化编程流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ug-nx-cam-平台\">UG NX CAM 平台</h3><p>Siemens NX是全球市场占有率最高的CAM软件之一，其特色在于CAD/CAM一体化和强大的五轴编程能力：</p>\n<p><strong>工作流程</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;零件模型分析&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;加工坐标系定义&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;毛坯/夹具设定&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;工序规划&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;刀具路径生成&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;仿真验证&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;后处理输出&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"零件模型分析\"] --&gt; B[\"加工坐标系定义\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"毛坯/夹具设定\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"工序规划\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"刀具路径生成\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"仿真验证\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"后处理输出\"]</pre><p>NX CAM核心操作类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>型腔铣（Cavity Mill）</strong>：分层粗加工，支持IPW（In-Process Workpiece）残料追踪</li>\n<li><strong>等高轮廓铣（Zlevel）</strong>：恒Z切削，适合陡峭壁面</li>\n<li><strong>固定轴曲面铣（Fixed Contour）</strong>：驱动方法 + 投影方法组合</li>\n<li><strong>可变轴曲面铣（Variable Contour）</strong>：五轴联动加工，刀轴自动插补</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"powermill-高速加工\">PowerMill 高速加工</h3><p>Autodesk PowerMill以高速加工（HSM）策略见长，特别适合模具行业：</p>\n<p>核心策略矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>刀具类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏置清除</td>\n<td>型腔粗加工</td>\n<td>高效铣刀</td>\n<td>螺旋进刀，恒定余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化等高</td>\n<td>半精加工</td>\n<td>圆鼻刀</td>\n<td>自动避让浅面区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光栅精加工</td>\n<td>平坦曲面</td>\n<td>球头刀</td>\n<td>均匀步距，方向可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D偏置精加工</td>\n<td>陡峭曲面</td>\n<td>球头刀</td>\n<td>等残留高度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流线精加工</td>\n<td>自由曲面</td>\n<td>球头刀</td>\n<td>沿UV流线切削</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PowerMill的Race Line策略（2024年新增）通过动态偏置算法在粗加工中实现近似恒定切削力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"刀具路径策略选择\">刀具路径策略选择</h3><p>策略选择的核心原则——匹配曲面特征：</p>\n<p><strong>粗加工策略决策</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开放型腔：优先摆线铣削（Trochoidal），径向切深小但轴向切深大</li>\n<li>深窄槽：插铣（Plunge Milling），利用Z轴刚性最强方向</li>\n<li>大余量去除：自适应清除（Adaptive Clearing），恒定WOC切削宽度</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>精加工策略决策</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>曲面斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 60°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span></span></span></span></span>：等高轮廓线</li>\n<li>曲面斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 30°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span></span></span></span></span>：光栅/放射状</li>\n<li>过渡区域：混合策略 + 重叠边界融合</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>切削参数计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c = \\frac{\\pi \\cdot D \\cdot n}{1000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_z = \\frac{v_f}{n \\cdot z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为切削速度(m/min)，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为刀具直径(mm)，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为主轴转速(rpm)，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为每齿进给(mm/tooth)。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碰撞检测\">碰撞检测</h3><p>五轴加工的碰撞风险远高于三轴，必须进行多层次检测：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>刀具与工件碰撞</strong>：过切检查，特别是刀柄/刀夹与已加工面</li>\n<li><strong>刀具与夹具碰撞</strong>：夹具模型必须完整建模</li>\n<li><strong>机床部件干涉</strong>：主轴头、工作台与工件/夹具的运动包络</li>\n<li><strong>行程极限检查</strong>：旋转轴是否超出物理行程</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NX和PowerMill均支持机床运动学仿真（Machine Simulation），加载机床3D模型后可实时检测所有可能的碰撞场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"加工仿真验证\">加工仿真验证</h3><p>仿真是&quot;虚拟试切&quot;，在不消耗材料和承担撞机风险的前提下验证程序正确性：</p>\n<p><strong>验证层次</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>刀路仿真</strong>：检查刀具路径几何正确性</li>\n<li><strong>材料去除仿真</strong>：对比加工结果与设计模型，检测过切/欠切</li>\n<li><strong>机床级仿真</strong>：含机床运动学，检测全部碰撞</li>\n<li><strong>G代码仿真</strong>：Vericut等第三方验证实际NC代码</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Vericut验证流程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导入机床模型（运动学+几何）</li>\n<li>导入毛坯、夹具、设计件模型</li>\n<li>读入后处理后的NC代码逐行执行</li>\n<li>自动标记：过切（红色）、欠切（蓝色）、碰撞（报警停止）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>残料对比分析的公差设置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过切公差：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.01\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>（绝对不允许）</li>\n<li>欠切公差：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+0.05\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>（留给后续工序）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年CAM技术的发展方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI驱动的工艺推荐</strong>：基于零件特征自动推荐加工策略和切削参数</li>\n<li><strong>云端CAM</strong>：SaaS模式的CAM平台，算力弹性扩展（如Autodesk Fusion云计算）</li>\n<li><strong>自适应粗加工2.0</strong>：实时结合机床传感器反馈调整刀路</li>\n<li><strong>数字线程闭环</strong>：加工结果自动反馈到CAM优化下一批次参数</li>\n<li><strong>生成式设计→直接CAM</strong>：拓扑优化结果的自动可制造性分析和工艺规划</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在NX CAM中对一个模具型芯进行完整编程：粗加工（型腔铣）→ 半精加工（等高）→ 精加工（3D偏置），记录每步的IPW变化。</li>\n<li>对比同一零件使用常规行切与摆线铣粗加工的时间和刀具磨损差异（在PowerMill中模拟）。</li>\n<li>使用Vericut对一段五轴NC代码进行验证，人为引入一处刀柄碰撞错误，观察软件如何报警。</li>\n<li>计算：加工铝合金7075，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=10\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的4刃硬质合金立铣刀，推荐切削速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>m/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c=200\\text{m/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/min</span></span></span></span></span></span>，每齿进给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_z=0.05\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，求主轴转速和进给速度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CAM编程是将设计意图转化为制造指令的核心技术环节。UG NX适合CAD/CAM一体化的航空航天领域，PowerMill在模具高速加工中优势明显。正确的策略选择、充分的碰撞检测和严格的仿真验证三位一体，才能确保程序安全可靠。随着AI辅助工艺规划的成熟，CAM编程正在从&quot;经验驱动&quot;向&quot;数据驱动&quot;转型，但对加工原理的深刻理解仍是不可替代的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CAM编程与仿真","id":"cam编程与仿真"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"UG NX CAM 平台","id":"ug-nx-cam-平台"},{"level":3,"text":"PowerMill 高速加工","id":"powermill-高速加工"},{"level":3,"text":"刀具路径策略选择","id":"刀具路径策略选择"},{"level":3,"text":"碰撞检测","id":"碰撞检测"},{"level":3,"text":"加工仿真验证","id":"加工仿真验证"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多轴加工技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/multi-axis-machining"},"next":{"title":"精密测量与质量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/precision-measurement"}}